        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/36566.jpg"
        },
        "description": "A child soldier. His parents were killed by an airstrike by a F-22 Raptor. Picked up as a child soldier soon after this traumatic event. Despite his intense hatred of weapons, Jonah decides to work under the enigmatic arms dealer, [Koko Hekmatyar](https://anilist.co/character/33451/Hekmatyar-Koko). Though he is young, his skills on the battlefield are extraordinary and is frequently shown besting men much older than himself. Also, infrequently displays a childish nature. Is shown to dislike mathematics and science and excels at languages.\n\nHis primary weapon in season 1 is an FN FNC and in season 2 it is the Magpul Masada.",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": null
